      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُخْنٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَخُنَ</span>: [commonly used as
a simple subst., meaning <i>Thickness,</i> &amp;c.:] one
says <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُوْبٌ لَهُ ثُخْنٌ</span> [<i>A garment,</i> or <i>piece of cloth,
